MODEL WEIGHTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No model weights are contained in this repository. They are downloaded at
run time by the demo, from the publisher, into the app's own storage, and
each carries the licence its publisher set — this project redistributes
none of them.

Verified by this project, because a licence is the one blocker no
measurement can fix (SPEC §144):

